  "Import aus Tabellenkalkulation (CSV / DBF)": ["Import from spreadsheet (CSV / DBF)", "Importar desde hoja de cálculo (CSV / DBF)", "Import depuis un tableur (CSV / DBF)", "Импорт из таблицы (CSV / DBF)", "从电子表格导入（CSV / DBF）"],
  "Erste Zeile = Spaltenüberschriften. Erkannt werden u.a.: ISBN, EAN, BX, Class, Autor, Titel, Seiten, Verlag, Bindung, Listenpreis, Datum, Originaltitel, Sprache, Reihe, Thema, Standort, Übersetzer, Auflage, Inhalt, Notiz, Lesestatus, Bewertung, eBook. Englische Spaltennamen (Author, Title, Publisher …) werden ebenfalls erkannt. Mindestens ISBN, Autor oder Titel.": [
    "First row = column headings. Recognised (among others): ISBN, EAN, BX, Class, Author, Title, Pages, Publisher, Binding, Price, Date, Language, Series, Topic, Location, Translator, Content, Notes, Rating, eBook, as well as the German names (Autor, Titel, Verlag …). At least ISBN, author or title.",
    "Primera fila = encabezados. Se reconocen, entre otros: ISBN, EAN, BX, Class, Author, Title, Pages, Publisher, Binding, Price, Date, Language, Series, Topic, Location, Translator, Content, Notes, Rating, eBook y los nombres alemanes (Autor, Titel, Verlag …). Como mínimo ISBN, autor o título.",
    "Première ligne = en-têtes. Reconnus entre autres : ISBN, EAN, BX, Class, Author, Title, Pages, Publisher, Binding, Price, Date, Language, Series, Topic, Location, Translator, Content, Notes, Rating, eBook ainsi que les noms allemands (Autor, Titel, Verlag …). Au minimum ISBN, auteur ou titre.",
    "Первая строка – заголовки. Распознаются, в частности: ISBN, EAN, BX, Class, Author, Title, Pages, Publisher, Binding, Price, Date, Language, Series, Topic, Location, Translator, Content, Notes, Rating, eBook, а также немецкие названия (Autor, Titel, Verlag …). Нужен хотя бы ISBN, автор или название.",
    "第一行为列标题。可识别：ISBN、EAN、BX、Class、Author、Title、Pages、Publisher、Binding、Price、Date、Language、Series、Topic、Location、Translator、Content、Notes、Rating、eBook，以及德语列名（Autor、Titel、Verlag …）。至少需要 ISBN、作者或书名。"],
